{"id": "20491793", "revid": "38004052", "url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=20491793", "title": "Michel Zumkeller", "text": "Michel Zumkeller (born 21 January 1966 in Belfort) is a French politician of the Union of Democrats and Independents (UDI), part of the Radical Party, who has been serving as a member of the National Assembly of France, representing the Territoire de Belfort department. \nIn parliament, Zumkeller serves on the Finance Committee. He was previously a member of the Committee on Cultural Affairs and Education (2017-2020) and the Committee on Legal Affairs (2009-2020). \nHe lost his seat in the first round of the 2022 French legislative election. "}
